  <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ticker-track">
      <span>DRONE TOWER NETWORK</span><span>-</span><span>CIVIC RESPONSE</span><span>-</span><span>EMERGENCY MESH</span><span>-</span><span>ROOFTOP SAFE ROUTES</span><span>-</span><span>POSTAL MODERNISATION</span><span>-</span><span>UTILITY SUPPORT</span><span>-</span>
      <span>DRONE TOWER NETWORK</span><span>-</span><span>CIVIC RESPONSE</span><span>-</span><span>EMERGENCY MESH</span><span>-</span><span>ROOFTOP SAFE ROUTES</span><span>-</span><span>POSTAL MODERNISATION</span><span>-</span><span>UTILITY SUPPORT</span><span>-</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section id="civic-mission">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">The Civil-Service Wedge</div>
        <h3>Build public value first. Let logistics dependency follow.</h3>
        <p>
          Aurora Bridge is positioned as a civic upgrade before it becomes a commercial logistics rail. The first value is helping
          police, ambulance, fire, councils, civil engineers and utilities respond faster, communicate through disruption and move urgent payloads across controlled local corridors.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card wide"><h4>Core Concept</h4><p>Aurora turns modular towers, rooftop pads and local mesh nodes into an emergency-ready infrastructure layer. The same network that supports public-service response can later support postal returns, retail logistics, utility teams and secure neighbourhood delivery.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h4>Emergency Response</h4><p>Authenticated distress signals can trigger telemetry relay, aerial scene visibility, location marking and delivery of approved emergency kits.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h4>Public Servant Safety</h4><p>Police, council workers, engineers or medical staff can request support where ordinary comms are slow, unavailable or unsafe.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h4>Civil Disruption</h4><p>During outages, floods, road incidents or unrest, local nodes can preserve communications and provide situational awareness.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="infrastructure" style="margin-top:42px">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Physical Network Layer</div>
        <h3>Drone towers become civic infrastructure furniture.</h3>
        <p>
          The tower is not just a delivery locker. It is a secure parcel vault, drone dock, telemetry relay, mesh communications point,
          battery service location, emergency bulletin cache and controlled local logistics node.
